WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.720
<i>And now, the weather for the seven cities.</i>

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:08.530
<i>Strong air currents have 
enlarged the large sandstorm</i>

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:12.750
<i>that formed in the center of the continent.</i>

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:17.510
<i>It's expected to reach the west soon.</i>

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:24.180
<i>Residents in the area are advised to take shelter.</i>

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:21.900
To the main street! Hurry!

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:25.470
Gofsef! Where are you?!

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:26.570
Hurry! This way!

00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:27.720
Gofsef!

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:32.320
<i>There is risk of widespread plant disruption
through the late afternoon.</i>

00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:29.920
What's going on?!

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Please prepare as best you can!</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:41.170
He ran outside to make sure 
nobody else got hurt...

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:48.730
There are more of those things!

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:49.660
Meryl!

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:52.030
They're bombs! Be careful! Damn it!

00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:53.380
Bombs?!

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:56.500
Tonis!

00:00:57.470 --> 00:00:58.510
I'm here to help!

00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:03.570
Damn! It won't come off!

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:04.940
Don't mess with it!

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:08.730
This design... It's gotta be
 the work of E. G. Bomber.

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:11.300
An amateur won't be able to dismantle it.

00:01:13.230 --> 00:01:14.390
Get back!

00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:18.760
Please! Save the town!

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:31.280
"E. G. Bomber"?

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:34.050
His real name is Ethan Gilbert Hamilton.

00:01:34.050 --> 00:01:39.100
He takes lives so easily that he earned 
himself the nickname "Easy Bomber."

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:40.880
Worst bomb maniac ever.

00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:43.200
What does he want with this town?

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.320
Who knows?

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:46.260
How do we survive?

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:48.780
We'll have to ask the bomber 
himself how to disable these.

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:51.240
Assuming there <i>is</i> a way.

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:53.250
Then I'll find him and capture him.

00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:55.490
At any rate, don't lose heart.

00:01:56.330 --> 00:01:57.720
Vash...

00:01:57.720 --> 00:01:59.100
But where is he?

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:03.220
His type likes to watch 
their "work" play out.

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:07.380
A place with a good view of the area...

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:19.370
There he is! Get him!

00:02:19.370 --> 00:02:20.160
Hurry!

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:27.620
Land mines?!

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:30.960
This whole town is full of my creations.

00:02:32.980 --> 00:02:34.560
E. G. Bomber?

00:02:36.650 --> 00:02:39.760
I no longer go by that.

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:43.540
Thanks to someone, I've been reborn.

00:02:56.450 --> 00:03:01.390
E. G. the Mine... That's my new name!

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:07.710
Now then, where's the treasure?

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:41.580
Now then, where's the treasure?

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:51.600
He's after the plant, too!

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:11.950
That must be it.

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:24.270
Vash!

00:05:27.080 --> 00:05:28.630
I get it now.

00:05:28.630 --> 00:05:31.850
The moment you get involved with him, 
you get swept into trouble.

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:35.760
The Humanoid Typhoon's a fitting name.

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:37.410
What do you mean by that?

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:40.680
Whoa there. Stay back.

00:05:40.680 --> 00:05:43.990
Unless your idea of a good time 
is suicide with a drunk.

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:46.280
This is no time for your 
trademark cynicism...

00:05:47.170 --> 00:05:48.740
Suicide?

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:50.200
That's it!

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:54.410
Stay back!

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:56.720
The town's covered in explosives!

00:05:56.720 --> 00:05:58.270
You there!

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:04.510
#03 Bright Light, Shine through the Darkness

00:06:19.470 --> 00:06:24.410
Don't worry. Vash will take care of it.

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:31.810
So you're here.

00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:33.490
Disable the bombs.

00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:39.960
You can't get me with the same old trick!

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:57.290
If it's the plant that you want, 
then your business here is done!

00:06:57.290 --> 00:06:59.270
Disable the bombs now!

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:01.060
You don't get it, do you?

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:03.610
I'm not killing to steal...

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:06.110
I'm stealing to kill!

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:11.070
Now suffer!

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:17.790
Enough.

00:07:19.890 --> 00:07:21.080
Damn!

00:07:28.310 --> 00:07:29.270
Vash!

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:50.280
I beat the one and only Vash the Stampede!

00:07:51.140 --> 00:07:52.580
E. G. Bomber!

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:55.420
I told you it's <i>the Mine</i>!

00:08:00.130 --> 00:08:01.960
You! Wh-What the—

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:04.310
Tell us how to disable the bombs! Or else...

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:06.190
We'll all die together!

00:08:06.190 --> 00:08:07.420
Damn you!

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:09.490
Get off!

00:08:10.230 --> 00:08:10.840
Spit it out!

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:14.190
Talk!

00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:19.980
The red button on my back!

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:23.100
Push it! Push it already!

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:36.310
We're saved! We're saved!

00:08:36.310 --> 00:08:39.210
Are you all right? Is anyone injured?

00:08:43.930 --> 00:08:45.880
You killed my son!

00:08:47.930 --> 00:08:49.220
No, Nebraska.

00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:50.840
Out of my way, Vash!

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:52.920
You'd protect this scoundrel?!

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:54.820
There's no point in revenge.

00:08:54.820 --> 00:08:57.390
Whose side are you on?!

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:18.760
Run...

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:19.570
Huh?

00:09:19.980 --> 00:09:23.260
Everyone, run! Get outside of town!

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:25.830
You're not getting away!

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.090
Whoopsies!

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:31.930
You suck!

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:35.130
Hurry! Get outta here!

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:36.360
Let's beat it!

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:37.130
What about the Bomber?

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:38.430
Not now! Run!

00:09:40.280 --> 00:09:41.660
Hurry, everyone!

00:09:49.990 --> 00:09:51.750
It's him!

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:57.110
You grace me with your presence!

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:30.020
Master... Knives...

00:10:40.020 --> 00:10:44.400
Have you ever desired 
to converse with a god...

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:52.030
Vash?

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:54.610
It's been so long.

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:58.930
I see you still have that gun.

00:10:58.930 --> 00:11:00.380
Why are you here?

00:11:02.060 --> 00:11:03.720
Is it the plant?

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:06.990
I'm taking it back. It belongs to me.

00:11:06.990 --> 00:11:07.970
Or rather...

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:10.520
It belongs to <i>us.</i>

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:12.320
I won't let you take it.

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:15.050
It's what's keeping the people 
of this town alive!

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:21.030
You won't let me? Who's side are you on?

00:11:22.710 --> 00:11:24.460
It must feel so nice.

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:28.820
All those flashy moves to save those people,
 earning their thanks...

00:11:28.820 --> 00:11:31.600
A cure for your loneliness.

00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:35.340
You haven't changed at all!

00:11:37.350 --> 00:11:38.490
The same...

00:11:41.440 --> 00:11:43.010
could be said of you.

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:57.770
You can't even control your gate yet?

00:11:57.770 --> 00:11:58.780
Nai?

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:01.060
Nai?!

00:12:02.210 --> 00:12:04.210
Goodbye, Vash.

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:10.650
Are you the boss?!

00:12:10.650 --> 00:12:11.710
Take this!

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:17.270
Nai?

00:12:18.010 --> 00:12:19.020
Damn!

00:12:21.680 --> 00:12:24.370
Where'd he go?!

00:12:57.960 --> 00:12:59.590
Run, Nebraska!

00:13:13.610 --> 00:13:15.560
Someone, Nebraska needs help!

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:17.610
Don't die on me.

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:18.770
Stop, Nai!

00:13:19.800 --> 00:13:21.030
Stop!

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:51.350
There.

00:14:08.510 --> 00:14:10.030
You're not taking our plant!

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:18.080
Do you hear me?!

00:14:27.660 --> 00:14:29.050
You should step aside.

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:31.960
You have no chance in a fight.

00:14:31.960 --> 00:14:34.600
Oh, you decided to show up, Doctor.

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:39.130
Good timing. Go and recover the other one.

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:45.280
I'll handle this.

00:14:47.010 --> 00:14:48.610
Not on my watch!

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:11.150
Rosa!

00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:43.460
Here you are...

00:16:15.900 --> 00:16:16.690
Nai!

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:20.900
Get away from there!

00:16:20.900 --> 00:16:22.170
Put the plant down!

00:16:26.030 --> 00:16:28.460
Whose side are you on?

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:32.600
Are you sure it's this way?

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:35.720
Don't lose your step. 
I don't want to die in a splat.

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:38.790
Like I said, this is no time for your—

00:16:39.530 --> 00:16:41.690
Tonis? What are you doing here?

00:16:41.690 --> 00:16:43.900
Mom said to hide...

00:16:44.260 --> 00:16:45.940
So she's still in town.

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:48.810
Is that...

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:53.470
The plant...

00:16:53.960 --> 00:16:55.570
You never change.

00:16:56.090 --> 00:16:58.790
Still a daydreamer full of empty words.

00:16:58.790 --> 00:16:59.940
Stop!

00:17:01.270 --> 00:17:03.110
Just stand back and watch.

00:17:03.110 --> 00:17:04.960
Watch them all perish.

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:10.820
I'll say it again... Put the plant down!

00:17:10.820 --> 00:17:12.320
You'd shoot me?

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:16.000
Your own big brother?

00:17:38.760 --> 00:17:42.970
In the past, God rained fire from the sky,

00:17:43.480 --> 00:17:46.460
destroying the city of depraved fools.

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:47.960
Don't do it...

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:51.730
To fix the world once and for all,

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:53.950
I'm moving ahead.

00:17:55.370 --> 00:17:59.410
To bring everything back to even.

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:01.780
The whole town?

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:04.100
Rosa, run!

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:16.710
Hurry.

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:29.050
Hurry!

00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:51.020
Why, Nai?!

00:19:04.840 --> 00:19:05.950
Tonis!

00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:13.000
Why... Why?!

00:19:13.410 --> 00:19:15.420
Why, Nai?!

00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:35.070
Good job. You're a tough one.

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:39.930
Can't say you're looking good, 
but you lucked out.

00:19:39.930 --> 00:19:44.430
That, too, is a talent 
all good journalists need.

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:52.110
Vash! Rosa!

00:20:04.840 --> 00:20:06.060
Tonis...

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:11.990
They took everything. 
The plant, the people, the town...

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:14.910
There's no way we can survive now.

00:20:16.220 --> 00:20:17.240
Rosa...

00:20:18.870 --> 00:20:22.570
That monster is your brother, right?

00:20:25.210 --> 00:20:28.100
I promise I'll get your plant back!

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:29.650
No matter how long it takes...

00:20:29.650 --> 00:20:31.080
Go away.

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:35.480
Get out of this town right now.

00:20:36.850 --> 00:20:41.130
If you hadn't come here, 
none of this would have happened.

00:20:41.860 --> 00:20:44.510
Don't you ever show your face here again...

00:20:45.270 --> 00:20:47.360
Humanoid Typhoon.

00:21:08.930 --> 00:21:10.150
Vash!

00:21:12.380 --> 00:21:13.590
Vash!

00:21:15.010 --> 00:21:16.140
Vash!

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:18.110
Vash!

00:21:36.320 --> 00:21:37.420
How?

00:21:38.880 --> 00:21:40.550
How, after all they said to you...

00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:46.660
How can you smile like that?

00:21:49.110 --> 00:21:52.780
I don't deserve to cry.

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:57.060
Where are you going?

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:01.160
East.

00:22:02.470 --> 00:22:03.590
East?

00:22:11.540 --> 00:22:15.820
Far east, to JuLai, the third city.

00:22:16.640 --> 00:22:18.450
That's where he is.

00:22:20.020 --> 00:22:27.640
<i>Your light...</i>

00:22:34.100 --> 00:22:38.400
<i>If that light never changes</i>

00:22:38.400 --> 00:22:42.830
<i>And continues to shine high above the sky</i>

00:22:42.830 --> 00:22:47.140
<i>Even when I’m lost, 
even when I’m struggling</i>

00:22:47.140 --> 00:22:51.390
<i>I’ll continue to search for you</i>

00:22:51.390 --> 00:22:55.680
<i>Even on days of sickness or sadness</i>

00:22:55.680 --> 00:23:00.060
<i>I’ll open the window to a new morning</i>

00:23:00.060 --> 00:23:04.250
<i>I’m moving forward, I’m standing still</i>

00:23:04.250 --> 00:23:07.810
<i>Tell the people who are praying</i>

00:23:07.810 --> 00:23:13.770
<i>But today this flower 
before me is praising you</i>

00:23:13.770 --> 00:23:16.780
<i>My song is a song of joy and wishes</i>

00:23:16.780 --> 00:23:19.500
<i>Yes, I’m reaching out</i>

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:24.840
<i>But you’re too high up 
in the evening stars</i>

00:23:24.840 --> 00:23:30.810
<i>But today this flower 
before me is praising you</i>

00:23:30.810 --> 00:23:33.960
<i>My song is a song of joy and wishes</i>

00:23:33.960 --> 00:23:36.660
<i>Yes, I try to reach out</i>

00:23:36.660 --> 00:23:41.820
<i>But you’re too high up 
in the evening stars</i>
